            <p class="uniko-pdp-key-text" data-i18n="pdp_yiri_key2_desc">A rich botanical butter so skin does not feel stripped after the wash.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="uniko-pdp-key-card" role="listitem">
          <div class="uniko-pdp-key-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg class="uniko-pdp-key-svg" width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none">
              <path d="M24 10v8M20 18h8M14 32c4-8 12-12 20-14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
