  </div>
</div>

<div class="uniko-pdp-faq">
  <div class="uniko-pdp-block-inner">
    <h2 class="uniko-pdp-block-title" data-i18n="pdp_faq_title">Frequently asked questions</h2>
    <div class="uniko-pdp-faq-list">
      <details class="uniko-pdp-faq-item">
        <summary data-i18n="pdp_yiri_faq_q1">How do I use YIRI Soap?</summary>
        <p data-i18n="pdp_yiri_faq_a1">Work into a lather with water and apply to damp skin. Rinse thoroughly.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="uniko-pdp-faq-item">
        <summary data-i18n="pdp_yiri_faq_q2">Can the whole family use it?</summary>
        <p data-i18n="pdp_yiri_faq_a2">Yes. It is formulated for men, women and kids — the whole family.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="uniko-pdp-faq-item">
        <summary data-i18n="pdp_yiri_faq_q3">Is it a daily soap?</summary>
        <p data-i18n="pdp_yiri_faq_a3">Yes. Use it daily on the body as your gentle botanical wash.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="uniko-pdp-faq-item">
        <summary data-i18n="pdp_yiri_faq_q4">Will it dry out my skin?</summary>
        <p data-i18n="pdp_yiri_faq_a4">It is made with aloe, shea and vitamin E to cleanse while helping skin stay comfortable after rinsing.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

